sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant ZSH as .zshrc<br/>ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=:4000
    participant CC as Claude Code<br/>(any project)
    participant RP as Routing Proxy<br/>~/.claude/proxy/<br/>port 4000
    participant LD as launchd<br/>auto-start on login
    participant ANT as Anthropic API<br/>api.anthropic.com
    participant LS as llama-server<br/>port 8089
    participant GPU as Local GPU<br/>gemma-4-12b-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf

    Note over LD,RP: macOS login — launchd starts routing proxy automatically
    LD->>RP: python3 ~/.claude/proxy/routing_proxy.py
    RP->>LS: GET /health (startup check)
    alt llama-server is running
        LS-->>RP: 200 OK
        RP->>RP: log "llama-server status: ONLINE ✓"
    else llama-server is offline
        RP->>RP: log "llama-server status: OFFLINE — gemma requests return 503"
    end

    Note over User,CC: User launches Claude Code (any project)
    User->>CC: claude --model gemma-4-12b<br/>or: claude (uses default Sonnet)
    ZSH-->>CC: ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000
    CC->>CC: stored API key loaded (from claude login)<br/>No ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN needed

    rect rgb(230, 245, 230)
        Note over CC,ANT: Model validation — Claude Code calls GET /v1/models before first request
        CC->>RP: GET /v1/models<br/>x-api-key: sk-ant-... (real key)
        RP->>ANT: GET /v1/models (forwarded)
        ANT-->>RP: real Claude model list
        RP->>RP: prepend gemma-4-12b to list
        RP-->>CC: merged model list (gemma-4-12b + Claude models)
        CC->>CC: model validated ✓
    end

    rect rgb(210, 232, 255)
        Note over User,ANT: Scenario A — claude-* model (Sonnet / Opus / Haiku)
        User->>CC: claude (default) or claude --model claude-opus-4-8
        User->>CC: prompt or tool call
        CC->>RP: POST /v1/messages<br/>model: "claude-sonnet-4-6"<br/>x-api-key: sk-ant-... (real key)
        RP->>RP: model starts with "claude-" → passthrough
        RP->>ANT: POST /v1/messages<br/>(body + headers forwarded unchanged)
        ANT-->>RP: Anthropic SSE stream
        RP-->>CC: SSE stream (unmodified passthrough)
        CC-->>User: streamed response
    end

    rect rgb(210, 255, 220)
        Note over User,GPU: Scenario B — gemma-4-12b (local, free, llama-server online)
        User->>CC: python3 run_claude.py (launches claude --model gemma-4-12b)
        User->>CC: prompt
        CC->>RP: POST /v1/messages<br/>model: "gemma-4-12b"
        RP->>RP: model != "claude-*" → route to local
        RP->>RP: Pop "thinking" & pop default "temperature"
        RP->>LS: POST /v1/messages<br/>(Anthropic format, with local overrides)
        LS->>GPU: Metal GPU inference<br/>-ngl 99, ctx 32768, --reasoning off
        GPU-->>LS: token stream
        LS-->>RP: Anthropic SSE stream (native)
        RP-->>CC: Anthropic SSE stream (adds Connection: close)
        CC-->>User: streamed response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 224, 210)
        Note over User,RP: Scenario C — gemma-4-12b, llama-server offline
        User->>CC: python3 run_claude.py
        User->>CC: prompt
        CC->>RP: POST /v1/messages<br/>model: "gemma-4-12b"
        RP->>LS: POST /v1/messages
        LS-->>RP: OSError: ConnectionRefused
        RP->>RP: catch OSError → friendly error response
        RP-->>CC: 503 + Anthropic error JSON<br/>"llama-server offline — run python3 run_server.py"
        CC-->>User: error message with start instructions
    end

    rect rgb(240, 240, 255)
        Note over CC,RP: Scenario D — smallFastModel background task<br/>(commit message, /compact, summary — only in local-llm-bench project)
        CC->>RP: POST /v1/messages<br/>model: "gemma-4-12b"<br/>(from .claude/settings.json smallFastModel)
        RP->>RP: model != "claude-*" → route to local
        RP->>LS: POST /v1/messages
        LS->>GPU: inference
        GPU-->>LS: response
        LS-->>RP: Anthropic response
        RP-->>CC: Anthropic response
    end
